01-genesis/25.tex-%		in Greece, this prediction contains two opposite meanings, and thus the
01-genesis/25.tex-%		person who receives it—Rebekah—can hear whatever she wants (consciously
01-genesis/25.tex-%		or subconsciously) to hear. It can be understood to mean that Jacob will
01-genesis/25.tex-%		serve Esau or that Esau will serve Jacob. I learned this from my senior
