01-genesis/32.tex-{
01-genesis/32.tex-	\hE{עַל כֵּן לֹא יֹאכְלוּ בְנֵי יִשְׂרָאֵל אֶת גִּיד הַנָּשֶׁה אֲשֶׁר עַל כַּף הַיָּרֵךְ עַד הַיּוֹם הַזֶּה כִּי נָגַע בְּכַף יֶרֶךְ יַעֲקֹב בְּגִיד הַנָּשֶׁה׃}
01-genesis/32.tex-}
01-genesis/32.tex-{
01-genesis/32.tex-	\eE{
01-genesis/32.tex-		On account of this the children of Israel to this day will
01-genesis/32.tex-		not eat the tendon of the vein that is on the inside of
01-genesis/32.tex-		the thigh, because he touched the inside of Jacob’s thigh,
01-genesis/32.tex-		the tendon of the vein.
01-genesis/32.tex-	}
01-genesis/32.tex-}
01-genesis/32.tex-{
01-genesis/32.tex-	End of class folks, great job all, no further questions.%
