08-samuel/1-17.tex-\Verse{25}
08-samuel/1-17.tex-{
08-samuel/1-17.tex-	\hX{
08-samuel/1-17.tex-		וַיֹּאמֶר אִישׁ יִשְׂרָאֵל הַרְּאִיתֶם הָאִישׁ הָעֹלֶה הַזֶּה כִּי לְחָרֵף אֶת־יִשְׂרָאֵל עֹלֶה וְהָיָה הָאִישׁ אֲשֶׁר־יַכֶּנּוּ יַעְשְׁרֶנּוּ הַמֶּלֶךְ עֹשֶׁר גָּדוֹל
08-samuel/1-17.tex-		וְאֶת־בִּתּוֹ יִתֶּן־לוֹ וְאֵת בֵּית אָבִיו יַעֲשֶׂה חפְשִׁי בְּיִשְׂרָאֵל׃
08-samuel/1-17.tex-	}
08-samuel/1-17.tex-}
08-samuel/1-17.tex-{
08-samuel/1-17.tex-	\eX{
08-samuel/1-17.tex-		And the men of Israel were saying [among themselves], “Do you see
08-samuel/1-17.tex-		that man coming out? He comes out to defy Israel! The man who
08-samuel/1-17.tex-		kills him will be rewarded by the king with great riches; he will
08-samuel/1-17.tex-		also give him his daughter in marriage and grant exemption to his
08-samuel/1-17.tex-		father’s house in Israel.”
08-samuel/1-17.tex-	}
08-samuel/1-17.tex-}
08-samuel/1-17.tex-{
08-samuel/1-17.tex-	\aB{
